          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201806/bg2018062226.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>上图是谷歌硬件产品的全家福，从左到右依次是 Google Pixel Buds，Pixel 2 XL，Pixel 2 XL，Pixel 2，Google Home Mini，Google Home，Google Home Max，Google Clips，Daydream View，Pixelbook Pen，Google Pixelbook。</p>\n<p>可以看到，这些产品大多采用了统一的设计语言：纯净的双色块对比。</p>",
